          ],
          "snippet": "China’s state news agency Xinhua said the two sides discussed “relevant agreement documents” and made new progress in their talks, but did not elaborate in a brief report. U.S. Senate Finance Committee Chairman Chuck Grassley told Reuters ..."
        },
        "https://www.chinausfocus.com/media-report/2019-04-03.html": {
          "title": "China-U.S. Trade Talks Enter Crunch Period as Liu Arrives in DC ...",
